# Build-context whitelist for the images/ Dockerfiles (context = repository root).
#
# The CPU/GPU single-user images only need the prebuilt theme wheel and the
# shared install helper — nothing else from the repository (no .git, no
# node_modules, no terraform state) is sent to the builder.

*

!images
!images/lib
!images/lib/install-theme.sh

!web
!web/theme
!web/theme/lab
!web/theme/lab/jlab-heroui-theme
web/theme/lab/jlab-heroui-theme/*
!web/theme/lab/jlab-heroui-theme/dist
web/theme/lab/jlab-heroui-theme/dist/*
!web/theme/lab/jlab-heroui-theme/dist/*.whl
